        "FRENCH": "Naviguez jusqu'à [Connexions] -> [Connecteurs] -> [Imprimante réseau].",
        "SPANISH": "Vaya a [Conexiones] -> [Conectores] -> [Impresora de red].",
        "ITALIAN": "Vai a [Connections] -> [Connectors] -> [Network printer].",
        "CHINESE": "导航至 [连接] -> [连接器] -> [网络打印机]。",
