      "TRANSLATIONS": {
        "ENGLISH": "Navigate to [Device settings] -> [Date and time] -> [NTP configuration].",
        "GERMAN": "Zu [Geräteeinstellungen] -> [Datum und Zeit] -> [NTP Konfiguration] navigieren.",
